  "title": "Winston Churchill",
  "summary": "Born at Blenheim Palace, Churchill became British prime minister on 10 May 1940 after Neville Chamberlain resigned and led the country through the Second World War. He lost office in the July 1945 election, returned in October 1951, retired as prime minister in April 1955, and died in London on 24 January 1965.",
